refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.parameters;


  command



    The command that will be executed.

&reftitle.errors;
An E_WARNING level error is generated when the pipe cannot be established.
Throws a ValueError if command is empty or contains null bytes.

&reftitle.changelog;





    &Version;
    &Description;





    8.0.0

     If command is empty or contains null bytes,
     shell_exec now throws a ValueError.
